:::text id=s5_card3_txt x=100 y=405 w=405 h=190 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="zap" color="#06B6D4"]:::
**Topic-Selective Energy**
More energetic when discussing product and engineering topics; lower energy in other areas.
:::

:::shape id=s5_card4_bg x=564 y=390 w=445 h=220 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

